<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>作品存檔 | TechMeow TW</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        // 同步日夜模式
        if (localStorage.theme === 'dark' || (!('theme' in localStorage) && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
            document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
        } else {
            document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark');
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;700;900&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; transition: all 0.5s ease; }
                /* 隱藏 Chrome, Safari 和 Opera 的滾動條 */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
        display: none;
                            }
        /* 隱藏 Firefox 和 IE/Edge 的滾動條 */
        html {
        scrollbar-width: none; /* Firefox */
        -ms-overflow-style: none;  /* IE and Edge */
            }

        .blob { position: absolute; filter: blur(80px); opacity: 0.15; z-index: -1; animation: move 20s infinite alternate; }
        @keyframes move { from { transform: translate(0, 0); } to { transform: translate(50px, 50px); } }

        .dark body { background-color: #0b0f1a; color: #f8fafc; }
        .light body { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; }

        /* 內容區塊微調 */
        .article-card { 
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
        .light .article-card { background: #ffffff; border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }

        /* 程式碼區塊美化 */
        code { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; }
        pre { border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #011627 !important; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen py-10">

    <div class="blob w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600 top-[-5%] left-[-5%]"></div>
    <div class="blob w-80 h-80 bg-purple-600 bottom-[5%] right-[-5%]"></div>

    <nav class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16 flex justify-between items-center">
        <a href="index.html" class="group flex items-center space-x-2 text-blue-500 font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left group-hover:-translate-x-2 transition-transform"></i>
            <span>Back to Archive</span>
        </a>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-40">TechMeow Taiwan Archive</div>
    </nav>

    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <header class="mb-16">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6">
                <span class="px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase">技術研究</span>
                <span class="text-gray-500 text-xs">2025.12.25</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-8 leading-tight tracking-tighter italic">
                TechMeow TW <br><span class="text-blue-600">豪華版架構說明</span>
            </h1>
            <div class="h-1.5 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600"></div>
        </header>

        <div class="article-card rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-16 mb-20 shadow-2xl">
            <section class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-blue max-w-none">
                <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 opacity-80">
                    本文深入解析如何結合毛玻璃特效、背景裝飾球以及日夜模式持久化，打造頂級的靜態作品集存檔系統。透過 Tailwind CSS 的輔助，我們能夠在不依賴繁重框架的情況下，實現極具未來感的視覺體驗。
                </p>
                
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center">
                    <i class="fas fa-microchip mr-3 text-blue-500"></i> 技術核心邏輯
                </h3>
                <p class="mb-6 opacity-80">
                    系統採用了 <strong>JSON 驅動機制</strong>，所有內容資料均存儲於 <code>post.json</code>。這意味著當您需要更新作品時，只需修改資料檔案，前端會自動渲染出對應的卡片與連結。
                </p>

                <div class="my-10">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest">Code Implementation</p>
                    <pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-blue-300">async function loadArchive() {
    const res = await fetch('./post.json');
    const data = await res.json();
    // 渲染卡片邏輯...
}</code></pre>
                </div>

                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center text-red-500">
                    <i class="fas fa-shield-alt mr-3"></i> 權利與支持說明
                </h3>
                <p class="mb-6 opacity-80">
                    本站點的所有內容受版權保護。請注意，目前作者<strong>不開放任何形式的技術支持</strong>。若您在實作過程中遇到困難，建議參考官方技術文檔進行自學排查。
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>

        <footer class="text-center">
            <div class="inline-flex flex-col items-center">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">發現內容錯誤或斷線？</p>
                <a id="inner-report" href="#" target="_blank" class="bg-red-500/10 text-red-500 border border-red-500/20 px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white transition-all shadow-lg">
                    <i class="fas fa-bug mr-2"></i> Report Archive Error
                </a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-20 text-[10px] text-gray-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase pb-10">© 2025 TechMeow Taiwan Storage</p>
        </footer>
    </article>

    <script>
        // 自動配置報錯網址
        document.getElementById('inner-report').href = `https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScKPaxc6ijZWKz0LzVakOd79j290zJ3RhAVV50e35nIk-xKqQ/viewform?usp=pp_url&entry.593912212=${encodeURIComponent("[CONTENT ERROR] " + window.location.href)}`;
    </script>
</body>
</html>
